  "title": "Kirby Corporation Announces 2025 Third Quarter Results",
  "summary": "PDF Version HOUSTON, Oct. 29, 2025 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) — Kirby Corporation (“Kirby”) (NYSE: KEX) today announced net earnings attributable to Kirby for the third quarter ended September 30, 2025, of $92.5 million or $1.65 per share, compared with earnings of $90.0 million, or $1.55 per share for the 2024 third quarter. Consolidated revenues for the […]",
